{"_id":"seZZor19pOSQdy2l","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-monster-core-2/sand-sentry.webp","items":[{"_id":"AAxJCcsnY50X5TVv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fist","sort":100000,"system":{"attackEffects":{"value":["blinding-sand"]},"bonus":{"value":17},"damageRolls":{"0":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"bludgeoning"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["unarmed"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!seZZor19pOSQdy2l.AAxJCcsnY50X5TVv"},{"_id":"fGdPSwN15R8tBeYZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Glass Armor","sort":200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>When the sand sentry takes electricity or fire damage, its outer layer of sand fuses into sheets of hardened glass for 1 minute. This increases the sand sentry's AC to 26 and grants it resistance 5 to acid, cold, electricity, fire, force, piercing, and slashing damage. A sand sentry can't use earth glide while glass armor is active.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"glass-armor","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["glass-armor"],"selector":"ac","value":2},{"key":"Resistance","predicate":["glass-armor"],"type":["acid","cold","electricity","fire","force","piercing","slashing"],"value":5}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!seZZor19pOSQdy2l.fGdPSwN15R8tBeYZ"},{"_id":"NatkooM8A9GYjSqi","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Blinding Sand","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>When the sand sentry critically hits with a fist Strike, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":"blinding-sand","traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!seZZor19pOSQdy2l.NatkooM8A9GYjSqi"},{"_id":"U5Ni9LuD95MzgWIy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Earth Glide","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A sand sentry can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.H6v1VgowHaKHnVlG]{Burrow} through earthen matter, including rock. When it does so, it moves at its full burrow Speed, leaving no tunnels or signs of its passing.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!seZZor19pOSQdy2l.U5Ni9LuD95MzgWIy"}],"name":"Sand Sentry","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":1},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":0},"str":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":24},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":90,"temp":0,"value":90},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"bleed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"paralyzed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"poison"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"sleep"}],"speed":{"details":"earth glide","otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":50}],"value":25}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["petran"]},"level":{"value":6},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>This creature of pure sand moves with an eerie grace, shifting back and forth between a detailed likeness of a human and a muted and featureless bipedal form. The sand sentry is often called upon by spellcasters to stand guard over an area of great importance; these elementals are patient participants in such roles, making them well suited for long-term service.</p><hr /><p>Certain earth elementals manifest as specific types of material, be they boulders, sand, or crystals.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core 2"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":14,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":60,"type":"tremorsense"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":16},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":12},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":14}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":14,"special":[]},"stealth":{"base":14,"special":[{"base":17,"label":"in sand"}]}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["earth","elemental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core-2.Actor.wpu3AsCPAKMSvDqN"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!seZZor19pOSQdy2l","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-monster-core-2/sand-sentry.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"pathfinder_monster_core_2__sand_sentry","sourcePack":"pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core-2","sourceDocId":"wpu3AsCPAKMSvDqN"}}}